&ANALYZE-SUSPEND _UIB-CODE-BLOCK _PROCEDURE pi-retorna-valor B-table-Win 
PROCEDURE pi-retorna-valor :
DEFINE INPUT PARAMETER P-CAMPO AS CHARACTER NO-UNDO.

    DEFINE VARIABLE P-VALOR AS CHAR INIT "" NO-UNDO.

    if  avail mgadm.ocor-bcia-bco then do:
        case p-campo:
            when "cod-banco" then
                assign p-valor = string(ocor-bcia-bco.cod-banco).
            when "cod-ocor-bcia-bco" then
                assign p-valor = string(ocor-bcia-bco.cod-ocor-bcia-bco).
            when "vl-ocor-bcia-bco" then
                assign p-valor = string(ocor-bcia-bco.vl-ocor-bcia-bco).
        end.
    end.
    return p-valor.
END PROCEDURE.

